open-ndi-monitor (0.1.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Initial Debian release
  * Fullscreen NDI video monitoring via SDL2
  * Audio output with libsamplerate resampling to 48kHz
  * Automatic reconnection with exponential backoff
  * INI-style configuration
  * Systemd service file included

